Planning

The planning phase involved defining the project's core objectives, scope, and key functionalities based on the identified problem of inefficient disaster reporting at the barangay level. The researchers outlined the essential features, including the two distinct user dashboards for victims and administrator, the real-time mapping system, and the incident reporting form. A detailed project timeline was established using a Gantt chart to allocate resources, set milestones, and manage task dependencies, ensuring the project remained on schedule. This timeline facilitated the iterative cycles of development, testing, and refinement.







