Analysis & Design

	The researchers designed the system architecture and user interface components based on the requirements gathered during the planning phase. The analysis focused on creating a scalable system that could handle real-time data processing, while the design phase involved creating detailed specifications for user interfaces and system components. This phase ensured that all design elements aligned with the goal of creating an efficient disaster response platform.

