Research Instrument

The researchers will use questionnaires as the main tool for gathering data. The questionnaire will be divided into three parts: (a) a cover letter, (b) personal information, and (c) evaluation items related to the system. The cover letter will introduce the purpose of the study, assure participants that their answers will remain confidential, and provide the researchers’ contact details in case they have questions or concerns. The second part of the questionnaire will ask for basic personal information, such as the respondent’s name, age, gender, occupation or role in the barangay, and years of experience in disaster management or barangay services.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            

	Additionally, the questionnaire will provide item statements related to the variables under evaluation. To measure the effectiveness of B-READY as the independent variable, the researchers will adopt an ISO/IEC 25010-based questionnaire from the study ICTeachMUPO: An Evaluation of Information E-Learning Module System for Faculty and Students by Urera and Balahadia (2019). This questionnaire will include eight indicators: Functional Suitability, Reliability, Portability, Usability, Performance Efficiency, Security, Compatibility, and Maintainability. Respondents will indicate their level of satisfaction or dissatisfaction with each statement by marking a check corresponding to their response. The questionnaire will use a five-point Likert scale ranging from 1 (“Strongly Disagree”) to 5 (“Strongly Agree”).

To assess effectiveness, the ratings will be categorized with their associated mean ranges and descriptions.de

